<title>JAPAN: TABLE-Japan June corporate service prices up 1.5%.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Japan June corporate service prices up 1.5%.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's corporate service price index (CSPI) rose 1.5 percent in June from a year earlier but remained unchanged from a month earlier, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The overall index stood at 103.6 for June. The index tracks price movements in the service industry and uses 1990 as its base year.  </p>
<p>The following are percentage changes in components of the index year-on-year and month-on-month for June:</p>
<p>			    YEAR-ON-YEAR	    MONTH-ON-MONTH</p>
<p> Finance/Insurance     +0.4			 0.0</p>
<p> Real estate	     +1.4			 0.0</p>
<p> Transport		 +1.5			-0.3</p>
<p> Information services  +2.6			 0.0</p>
<p> Communications	  -0.3			-0.1</p>
<p> Advertising services  +3.0			+0.7</p>
<p> Lease/rental services -2.0			-0.1</p>
<p> Other services	  +2.5			+0.1</p>
</text>
